# P10 — Platform production grade

## North star (fit-aligned)

**Profile C HTTPS** on **one VPS** — four processes behind edge · CI smoke 4/4 · ops runbooks.

**Profile B IP (P7) stays** — P10 adds production path; does not remove staging IP.

**Exit admin HTTPS:** `{club}.admin.{platform_root}` — **not** admin custom apex (H-P6-03 defer).

→ [p10-app-fit.md](p10-app-fit.md)

